        "description": "Player skin tone, dichotomized to compare dark vs light skin. Main independent variable for testing whether darker-skinned players receive more red cards than lighter-skinned players. Derived from the two independent raters' skin ratings (rater1, rater2) as a mean and then classified into tercile-based groups; the statistical model uses the binary indicator IsDark.",
